"Secondary_products_revolution": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/0854_Ein_Krug_aus_Bronocice%2C_3.550_v._Chr..JPG/1920px-0854_Ein_Krug_aus_Bronocice%2C_3.550_v._Chr..JPG","title":"The Bronocice pot","desc":"A burnished brown clay vessel with a sharply angled lower body and a flaring rim, standing on a small metal support in a museum case; incised round its upper zone are schematic four-wheeled wagons, each a rectangle with a circle at every corner and a peaked outline above, beside a fir-tree motif and a zigzag band. Silar, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:0854_Ein_Krug_aus_Bronocice,_3.550_v._Chr..JPG","alt":"A burnished brown clay vessel with a sharply angled lower body and a flaring rim, standing on a small metal support in a museum case; incised round its upper zone are schematic four-wheeled wagons, each a rectangle with a circle at every corner and a peaked outline above, beside a fir-tree motif and a zigzag band"},
