"Stonehenge": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Stonehenge_Closeup_July_2018.jpg/1920px-Stonehenge_Closeup_July_2018.jpg","title":"Stonehenge","desc":"Standing sarsen uprights with several lintels still resting across them and other stones fallen among drought-browned grass, under a hazy summer sky, a bird perched on one upright and visitors small in the distance. Mball93, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stonehenge_Closeup_July_2018.jpg","alt":"Standing sarsen uprights with several lintels still resting across them and other stones fallen among drought-browned grass, under a hazy summer sky, a bird perched on one upright and visitors small in the distance"},
