"Samnium": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Pietrabbondante_-_Santuario_Italico_-_2024-09-07_13-57-34_001.JPG/1920px-Pietrabbondante_-_Santuario_Italico_-_2024-09-07_13-57-34_001.JPG","title":"The sanctuary at Pietrabbondante","desc":"The theatre and temple of the Samnite sanctuary at Pietrabbondante, high in the mountains of Samnium.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pietrabbondante_-_Santuario_Italico_-_2024-09-07_13-57-34_001.JPG","alt":"Curved stone seating tiers of a small ancient theatre on a hillside, with squared temple foundations beyond and wooded hills stretching to the horizon."},
