"Via_Flaminia": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b7/Via_Flaminia%2C_Italy_%2843236836620%29.jpg/1920px-Via_Flaminia%2C_Italy_%2843236836620%29.jpg","title":"A Roman bridge on the Flaminian Way","desc":"A Roman bridge still standing on the line of the Via Flaminia, with the modern road running beside it.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Via_Flaminia,_Italy_%2843236836620%29.jpg","alt":"A low stone bridge of rough masonry spanning a shallow stream, its parapet overgrown, with a narrow asphalt road curving past it through trees."},
