"Campi_Flegrei": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/I08_465_%C2%BBBocca_Grande%C2%AB.jpg/1920px-I08_465_%C2%BBBocca_Grande%C2%AB.jpg","title":"The Bocca Grande fumarole","desc":"Steam and sulphurous gas pouring from the ground at the Solfatara above Pozzuoli.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:I08_465_%C2%BBBocca_Grande%C2%AB.jpg","alt":"White vapour drifting over rocks crusted yellow, orange and red with sulphur deposits."},
